  "description": "<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Overview</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Elevate your living space or product catalog with our beautifully handcrafted <b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">Water Hyacinth Storage Basket (Ref: VH24035)</b>. Expertly handwoven by skilled artisans in Vietnam, this basket combines natural organic aesthetic, open-work weave design, and sturdy functionality. Built around a durable iron frame, it offers both structure and rustic charm, making it a versatile storage solution for modern, boho, minimalist, or rustic interiors.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features</b></h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">100% Natural &amp; Sustainable Material:</b> Made from naturally harvested dried water hyacinth stems from Vietnam—an eco-friendly, fast-renewable material that is safe for the home and environment.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sturdy Iron Frame Structure:</b> Reinforced with an internal metal/iron frame, ensuring the basket retains its shape, withstands heavy daily use, and provides long-lasting durability.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Intricate Open-Weave Design:</b> Features an elegant open-knit pattern that creates a lightweight look while allowing air circulation, keeping stored items fresh and dry.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Excellence:</b> Every piece is uniquely woven by traditional Vietnamese artisans, giving each basket its own distinct character and craftsmanship quality.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multi-Functional Utility:</b> Ideal for organizing blankets, toys, magazines, laundry, or home accessories. It can also serve as a decorative plant holder or stylish shelf organization bin.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Specifications</b></h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Item Code:</b> VH24035</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material:</b> 100% Natural Dried Water Hyacinth + Sturdy Metal/Iron Frame</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Origin:</b> Vietnam (Handmade by Vietcraft)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Shape:</b> Oval / Round</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color:</b> Natural Golden Warm Brown (Untreated natural tone)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Usage:</b> Home Decor, Storage &amp; Organization, Plant Pot Cover, Hotel &amp; Resort Accessories</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization:</b> Sizes, shapes, and weaving styles can be customized upon request for wholesale orders.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Choose Vietnam Handicraft Products?</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">At <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Vietcraft</b>, we take pride in connecting traditional Vietnamese handicraft villages with the international market. Our products meet strict international quality control standards while supporting sustainable livelihoods for rural artisans across Vietnam.</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For B2B / Wholesale Enquiries:</b> We offer competitive FOB pricing, OEM/ODM services, and scalable production capacities tailored to global importers, retailers, and interior designers.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Care Instructions</b></h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\">Keep in a dry, ventilated indoor environment.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\">Wipe clean with a soft, dry or slightly damp cloth.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\">Avoid direct exposure to prolonged moisture or extreme sunlight to preserve natural colors and frame integrity.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interested in wholesale pricing or custom specifications?</b> 📩 <b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Contact Us:</b> vietcraft2006@gmail.com</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">🌐 <b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Website:</b> <a class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwjU3tbA66aWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQiQE\">https://vietcraft.vn</a></p>",
